+- **Second pass, 26 November 2026, 07:14 UTC (cl-6.startups wake):** re-read at source: ARRISCA C 2026 (closes 23:59 on 18 December: confirmed), INPI/EUIPO SME Fund (4 December: confirmed). Corrected: Unicorn Factory Lisboa Incubation Programme closes on 1 December 2026 (its programme page and active programs page), not 3 December; the prediction has a correcting line. No new fact: the one round found by a second search, Hope Care's EUR 6 million Series A (8 September 2026, ECO), was already on the site (578 facts). Predictions: lines added for the EIT Catalyse NEB call and the EIC Pre-Accelerator, which were open but had none. Still not re-read: London round amounts.
